  {
    "kind": "table",
    "slide": 2,
    "role": "context-service-features",
    "text": "Proposed Compass feature\nWhat the service provides\nDelivery boundary\nTrusted intent\nand identity\nInterpret the agreed intent and\nvalidate caller/service authority.\nConfirm intent producer and\ntrusted identity propagation.\nAtlas context\nservice\nReturn permitted context, status,\nfreshness and an approved route class.\nValidate required fields, access\nand data coverage.\nContext delivery\nand fallback\nDeliver context to an authorized\nCSR or accepted AI destination.\nGenesys enforces routing and\nfallback; late results cannot reroute.",
    "textChars": 531,
    "textLines": 4,
