    "text": "BSC need\nCompass feature direction\nReadiness and timing\nBenefits and\nknowledge lookup\nCSR Chat benefit answers and\napproved KB / SMP retrieval\nin Shield Advisor.\nBenefit Q&A foundation.\nBSC integration to validate.\nQ1 planning track.*\nTranscription and\ncall summaries\nCompass Voice transcription and\ndraft summaries for CSR review.\nSeparate voice/audio scope.\nQ2 planning track.*\nAgree retention and writeback.\nAgent queries and\nworkflow support\nProposed live queries, case/rule\nguidance, response and follow-up\ndrafts for CSR review.\nProposed extension.\nQ3 query planning track.*\nCase/rule scope to agree.",
