    "slide": 4,
    "role": "roadmap-summary",
    "text": "Stage\nTiming\nCompass focus\n0  Prove\nDec 2026\nDemonstrate one journey; agree intent, context,\nPega overlap, interface and accountable owners.\n1  MVP\nFeb 1–28, 2027\nLaunch target\nOne journey with context before routing. Self-service\nrequires an accepted voice / AI destination.\n2  Widen\nMar–Jun 2027\nMonthly releases\nExpand validated intents toward the Top 20 ambition;\nseparate agent-assist features need their own acceptance.\n3  Routing pilots\nQ2 discovery\nQ3 2027 proposed\nDesign all-LOB routing, digital context, callbacks and\nsupervisory assistance; pilot selected scopes.\n4  Expand\nQ4 2027\nProposed\nScale proven inbound scope; retire only accepted\nPega AI functions. Outbound / new channels remain future.",
    "textChars": 709,
