    "text": "Stage\nTiming\nDelivery approach\nDecision to proceed\n0  Prove\nDec 2026\nOne journey; agree intent, Atlas fields,\nPega overlap and interface.\nScope, contracts and\nowners accepted.\nReadiness\nJan 2027\nProve identity, approved reads, typed result\nand selected SDK / API path.\nEnd-to-end, timeout and\nlate-result checks pass.\n1  MVP target\nFeb 1–28, 2027\nContext before routing; human fallback.\nVoice-agent readiness gates self-service.\nBSC launch acceptance;\nsupport and rollback ready.\n2  Widen\nMar–Jun 2027\nMonthly releases\nExpand validated intents toward Top 20;\nagent assist has separate release gates.\nContext, wait, routing,\nquality and cost accepted.\nPhase 2\ndiscovery\nQ2 2027\nParallel work\nDesign all-LOB routing, digital journeys,\ncallbacks and supervisory assistance.\nPilot scope, signals, owners\nand capacity agreed.\n3  Pilots*\nQ3 2027\nPilot selected flows; validate exact Pega\nfunction transition where selected.\nService continuity and\nattributable value accepted.\n4  Expand*\nQ4 2027\nScale proven inbound scope; retire only\naccepted migrated Pega AI functions.\nSustained value and\noperational ownership.",
